<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Volkswagen.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Volkswagen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    625.00 DEM		PREMIUM	12.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.25 SFR		  GEARING	8.40 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.DEC.96-29.MAY.98   PAYDATE	10.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  621.00 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
